    "      - name: Install CUDA toolkit (full)\n        id: cuda\n        uses: Jimver/cuda-toolkit@v0.2.24   # settled action version; has CUDA 12.8.1 (first with sm_120)\n        with:\n          cuda: '12.8.1'\n          method: 'network'\n          # Newer CUDA network installs reject a bare \"full\" fetch \u2014 pin the components candle-CUDA\n          # (cudart/cublas/curand/nvrtc + dev import libs) and the llama.cpp nvcc build need.\n          sub-packages: '[\"nvcc\", \"cudart\", \"cublas\", \"cublas_dev\", \"curand\", \"curand_dev\", \"nvrtc\", \"nvrtc_dev\", \"thrust\", \"visual_studio_integration\"]'\n\n      # nvcc (candle-kernels) needs the MSVC host compiler cl.exe on PATH.\n"
